index 8c525e5..6b164e3 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Refresh changed call hierarchy declarations.** Expanding a retained function or method after its source changes now requires a fresh hierarchy selection. Unchanged declarations remain usable when another file is edited. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Search and replace named PHP arguments.** Structural patterns capture named values while retaining exact labels and written order. Reviewed replacements preserve captured expressions and keep positional argument tails distinct. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Follow literal array callbacks accurately.** Call hierarchy resolves known class names, object receivers and keyed arrays at their exact method selectors, respecting the selected PHP version and method visibility. Late-bound class names keep overridable implementations unresolved. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
